WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.726 --> 00:00:06.853
Oh, my God.

00:00:07.353 --> 00:00:08.938
Don’t look like no plane.

00:00:08.938 --> 00:00:10.773
Don't look like no helicopter.

00:00:10.773 --> 00:00:11.774
What the [bleep] is it?

00:00:12.317 --> 00:00:16.070
UFO sightings burst into the news in 1947.

00:00:16.696 --> 00:00:19.574
These sightings have continued
ever since.

00:00:19.574 --> 00:00:23.620
The Air Force made an effort to 
clear the air about the phenomenon.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:27.415
There's nothing to hide at all.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.753
I was stunned that we didn't
have the integrity to pursue this.

00:00:32.795 --> 00:00:33.254
The U.S.

00:00:33.254 --> 00:00:35.381
government closed its study of UFO’s

00:00:35.798 --> 00:00:39.302
and so the work fell
into the hands of civilian groups.

00:00:39.761 --> 00:00:42.013
The UFO reports not only 
exist, but persist.

00:00:42.221 --> 00:00:44.265
I mean, it's a definite UFO.

00:00:44.265 --> 00:00:48.144
The government owes it to this country
to investigate sightings

00:00:48.144 --> 00:00:49.854
of extraordinary objects.

00:00:49.854 --> 00:00:51.689
We cover the whole entire sky.

00:00:51.689 --> 00:00:54.984
People want to know, is this otherworldly?

00:00:55.193 --> 00:00:58.738
This could be one of the biggest events in

00:00:58.738 --> 00:01:00.865
all of human history.

